passphrase dialog (in the initrd) is shown as quickly as possible. The=20
devices I test with is a Lenovo X60 and ASRock E350M1 both running with=20
coreboot and the GRUB payload. The goal is to do this without having to=20
rebuild a Linux kernel, but only by run-time

